00:56:36.474 --> 00:56:40.474
Like, it's creating permission and a welcome mat

1288
00:56:41.425 --> 00:56:44.488
and something that's so accessible for anybody

1289
00:56:44.488 --> 00:56:47.149
no matter how much pain they're in or whatever circumstances

