00:56:50.926 --> 00:56:53.499
or giving yourself a high five in the mirror,

1293
00:56:53.499 --> 00:56:57.582
it may seem like childish or silly, but in truth,

1294
00:56:58.579 --> 00:57:01.829
there's a neurochemical thing that takes place

1295
00:57:01.829 --> 00:57:06.162
that sets in motion a chain of events that allow you

1296
00:57:07.131 --> 00:57:09.004
to take that initial action.

1297
00:57:09.004 --> 00:57:11.864
