1303
00:57:18.845 --> 00:57:22.054
Because the fact is, I used it in secret for three years.

1304
00:57:22.054 --> 00:57:24.251
To five, four, three, two, one, pick up that phone

1305
00:57:24.251 --> 00:57:25.776
that weighed 1000 pounds.

1306
00:57:25.776 --> 00:57:28.521
And part of the genius of this is that when you start

