1311
00:57:37.602 --> 00:57:41.164
And the more you repeat it, the more you break the pattern

1312
00:57:41.164 --> 00:57:44.371
of thinking and you program in a pattern of taking

1313
00:57:44.371 --> 00:57:45.329
small actions.

1314
00:57:45.329 --> 00:57:48.358
It creates agile moves, an agile mindset.

1315
00:57:48.358 --> 00:57:49.609
So that's one thing.

1316
00:57:49.609 --> 00:57:52.173
The second thing that's crazy cool about this

1317
00:57:52.173 --> 00:57:55.880
is that the reason why it's so fucking hard to change

1318
00:57:55.880 --> 00:57:59.171
is because you talk about changing with the prefrontal

1319
00:57:59.171 --> 00:58:00.004
cortex.

1320
00:58:00.004 --> 00:58:02.105
You're conscious when you sit in your therapist's chair

1321
00:58:02.105 --> 00:58:03.974
or you're listening to me and Rich,

1322
00:58:03.974 --> 00:58:07.917
and you're using this sort of strategic part of your brain.

1323
00:58:07.917 --> 00:58:10.199
The second that you're in a situation

1324
00:58:10.199 --> 00:58:13.943
where you're procrastinating or you're thinking negative

1325
00:58:13.943 --> 00:58:17.386
thoughts, it's your subconscious that's in charge of you.

1326
00:58:17.386 --> 00:58:20.332
And so in order to change, you have to interrupt

1327
00:58:20.332 --> 00:58:21.800
subconscious patterns.

1328
00:58:21.800 --> 00:58:24.833
You see the five second rule isn't just some dumb

1329
00:58:24.833 --> 00:58:26.249
counting backwards thing.

1330
00:58:26.249 --> 00:58:30.338
It is a form of metacognition that interrupts the pattern

1331
00:58:30.338 --> 00:58:32.798
stored in your subconscious brain.

1332
00:58:32.798 --> 00:58:34.907
Counting backwards requires you to focus,

1333
00:58:34.907 --> 00:58:37.675
which flips on your prefrontal cortex.

1334
00:58:37.675 --> 00:58:41.096
It maybe gives you a moment of control over what you think

1335
00:58:41.096 --> 00:58:41.929
and do next.

1336
00:58:41.929 --> 00:58:43.515
That's the genius of it.

1337
00:58:43.515 --> 00:58:46.852
And the reason why I'm so fucking passionate about this

1338
00:58:46.852 --> 00:58:50.302
is not only because kids can use it and senior citizens

1339
00:58:50.302 --> 00:58:51.135
