And, we have pediatricians around the world that are using

1346
00:59:05.626 --> 00:59:08.539
it to help kids interrupt thoughts that trigger anxiety.

1347
00:59:08.539 --> 00:59:11.146
Veterans organizations that are using five, four, three,

1348
00:59:11.146 --> 00:59:14.253
two, one, to help reprogram responses to triggers.

