00:59:22.751 --> 00:59:25.941
to tell me that of all of the tools that they give people

1352
00:59:25.941 --> 00:59:30.309
that have an inpatient commit, the single most positive

1353
00:59:30.309 --> 00:59:32.233
and effective tool is the five second rule,

1354
00:59:32.233 --> 00:59:35.400
because it is simple, you remember it,

