00:59:36.259 --> 00:59:39.906
and it immediately interrupts the negative and suicidal

1356
00:59:39.906 --> 00:59:41.605
ideations that torture people.

1357
00:59:41.605 --> 00:59:45.458
And speaking of suicide, we know of 111 people

1358
00:59:45.458 --> 00:59:48.411
who have stopped themselves from taking their lives

1359
00:59:48.411 --> 00:59:52.175
by five, four, three, two, one, asking for help.

1360
00:59:52.175 --> 00:59:55.464
So I am here to tell you, I don't give a fuck how stupid

1361
00:59:55.464 --> 00:59:56.587
