1362
00:59:56.587 --> 00:59:59.821
I want you to try it, I want you to share it with people,

1363
00:59:59.821 --> 01:00:03.222
because interrupting the patterns of thought and behavior

1364
01:00:03.222 --> 01:00:06.078
that are holding you back and pushing yourself

1365
01:00:06.078 --> 01:00:08.388
to take action or to think something different,

1366
01:00:08.388 --> 01:00:10.781
it is the only way you're gonna change.

1367
01:00:10.781 --> 01:00:14.466
And this is a tool that's gonna help you bridge that gap.

1368
